TY  - JOUR
TI  - Modelling foreign labour inflows using a dynamic microsimulation model of an ageing country - Slovakia
AU  - Štefánik, Miroslav
AU  - Miklošovič, Tomáš
VL  - 13
IS  - 2
PY  - 2020
DA  - 2020/08/31
